flowchart TB
    S["Specification: task + constraints"] --> C["Minimal change"]
    C --> G["Checks: tests, linters, architecture checks"]
    G --> R["Run: deploy or local smoke tests"]
    R --> L["Logs, errors, diffs through MCP / API / CLI"]
    L -->|signal diverges from the goal| C
    L -->|all green| D["Done: PR to merge"]
